OL,3,GNEWSACouncil set to approve #1m for
OL,4,Aflood defence project
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior councillors are expected to sign
OL,7,Foff #1m for planning and preparatory
OL,8,Fwork on a new flood defence scheme in
OL,9,FDerby.
OL,11,FThe money would be used to develop
OL,12,Fdetailed plans for a new project at
OL,13,FChaddesden Sidings, near Pride Park.
OL,15,FThe project forms part of phase three
OL,16,Fof the Our City Our River (OCOR) flood
OL,17,Falleviation scheme - which follows
OL,18,Fpreviously approved work along the
OL,19,FRiver Derwent.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
